      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `f28c9cc6cea79b92379056aba9a1fc505ddec69fffd7a9a2825a51774d4fe274--ByronLGA.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: BOCSAR — Crime statistics by LGA (NSW Bureau of Crime Statistics and Research)\n- Release or year: Current file checked 2026-11-01\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Summary of offences\" | a366a0764a057fd1512f65deaa9321bbab8423878f30eeed85c0ee06ed4c9ecf | missing |\n| \"Premises Type\" | 9e211fcfcca0d697644c4821dadf38947dac5175bc1b046e804f70ee4a9507a9 | missing |\n| \"Victims\" | 08597d25ff2c18f9d8a6654e76add4def1675b40b9f49384739fbc4d02d1b0a9 | missing |\n| \"Offenders\" | 01d923466571c943e553f31dd4417216943e1c52cfd0dd4ab880b9d52f279ef6 | missing |\n| \"Alcohol Related\" | 6401d79ee8340f150c79ac52541806d6af30a0fd83c2bebdbb770128904ad7b3 | missing |\n| \"Month\" | 607cbba53b8bcc82430f8525243ce4be78217c77ee02f52f4bcbc6d72f1a0b1a | missing |\n| \"Time\" | bf6751c4b9dd2fc2f6eb6205aad337d80ead9736acbd54cacee38946c1a6e1ff | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
